<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Independent · Non-partisan · International</div><h1>Where the world meets the story.</h1><p>EVATINI WORLD is an independent media organisation bringing together credible journalism, thoughtful analysis and compelling storytelling from South Africa, across Africa and around the world.</p><a class="btn" href="#latest">Explore our coverage</a><div class="hero-note">News · Analysis · Interviews · Documentaries · Podcasts</div></div></section>
