<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="wrap aboutgrid"><div><div class="eyebrow">About EVATINI WORLD</div><h2>South African roots. African perspective. International reach.</h2><p>EVATINI is inspired by a Johannesburg kasi expression meaning “where there is water”. Water sustains life and connects communities. We carry that spirit into media: creating space for stories, perspectives and conversations that nourish public understanding.</p><p>EVATINI WORLD is being built as an independent, non-partisan media organisation. Our ambition is to inform, educate and connect people through credible journalism and accessible storytelling.</p><a class="textlink" href="#contact">Contact the newsroom ↗</a></div><div class="quote">“Where the world meets the story.”<div class="meta">THE EVATINI WORLD PROMISE</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>What guides us</h2><span>Our editorial principles</span></div><div class="principles"><article class="principle"><h3>Accuracy</h3><p>We verify material facts, identify sources and correct mistakes transparently.</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>Independence</h3><p>Our editorial decisions are not directed by political parties or commercial interests.</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>Fairness</h3><p>We distinguish fact, allegation, analysis and opinion, and seek relevant responses.</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>Public interest</h3><p>We aim to inform people and deepen understanding of issues that matter.</p></article></div></div></section>
